{"unit_id":"xiaolulu0328__dsh-agnes-image#card-zh","repo":"xiaolulu0328/dsh-agnes-image","commit":"26ba3ae22f0048afa7f79cdcb5a24d5c89eccaa3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Agnes 生图是面向 DSH 网页客户端的图像生成插件，接入对话工具系统，让 AI 按用户提示调用 Agnes Image 2.5 Flash。它支持文字生成图片、基于参考图编辑和多图合成，可选择 1K 至 4K 档位、宽高比以及链接或 Base64 输出；结果可以作为会话附件预览，也可另存到指定本机目录。适合需要在 DSH 对话中创作、修改或组合图片的用户。使用前需配置 Agnes API Key，并可在设置中调整 Base URL、超时和保存目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:478-490","index.js:564-577","index.js:728-748","client.js:362-376"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaolulu0328__dsh-agnes-image#card-en","repo":"xiaolulu0328/dsh-agnes-image","commit":"26ba3ae22f0048afa7f79cdcb5a24d5c89eccaa3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Agnes Image adds an image tool to the DSH web client, using Agnes Image 2.5 Flash. It creates images from text, edits references, or combines images. Users can choose a size tier, aspect ratio, and URL or attachment output, with optional local saving. An Agnes API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:478-490","index.js:564-577","index.js:728-748","client.js:362-376"]}
