{"unit_id":"xiaolulu0328__dsh-agnes-image#feature-text2img","repo":"xiaolulu0328/dsh-agnes-image","commit":"26ba3ae22f0048afa7f79cdcb5a24d5c89eccaa3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Agnes 生图的功能「文生图」：根据 prompt 生成图片，可选择 1K、2K、3K 或 4K 档位及宽高比；结果以图片链接返回，也可选择 Base64 并保存为会话附件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:568-577"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaolulu0328__dsh-agnes-image#feature-img2img","repo":"xiaolulu0328/dsh-agnes-image","commit":"26ba3ae22f0048afa7f79cdcb5a24d5c89eccaa3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Agnes 生图的功能「参考图编辑」：提供一张公共 HTTPS 图片链接或图片 Data URI，再用 prompt 描述修改内容，工具将参考图和指令发送给 Agnes 并返回生成结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:534-542"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaolulu0328__dsh-agnes-image#feature-multi_image","repo":"xiaolulu0328/dsh-agnes-image","commit":"26ba3ae22f0048afa7f79cdcb5a24d5c89eccaa3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Agnes 生图的功能「多图合成」：提供至少两张参考图，并在 prompt 里说明各图用途及组合方式，工具据此请求生成合成图片。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:544-550"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaolulu0328__dsh-agnes-image#feature-status","repo":"xiaolulu0328/dsh-agnes-image","commit":"26ba3ae22f0048afa7f79cdcb5a24d5c89eccaa3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Agnes 生图的功能「配置状态检查」：调用只读的 agnes_image_status 可查看密钥是否可用、来源、Base URL 和超时，帮助排查配置未生效的问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:750-760"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaolulu0328__dsh-agnes-image#feature-settings","repo":"xiaolulu0328/dsh-agnes-image","commit":"26ba3ae22f0048afa7f79cdcb5a24d5c89eccaa3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Agnes 生图的功能「插件配置面板」：在插件配置界面填写 API Key、Base URL、超时和可选保存目录；界面提供保存和清除密钥操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:362-376"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaolulu0328__dsh-agnes-image#caveat-external-service","repo":"xiaolulu0328/dsh-agnes-image","commit":"26ba3ae22f0048afa7f79cdcb5a24d5c89eccaa3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Agnes 生图 使用前须知：提示词、参数及参考图会发送到配置的 Agnes API（默认 api.agnes-ai.cn），并需有效 API Key。（见 index.js:564-600）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:564-600"]}
